  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Accountability and Governance Institutions in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening economic governance, policy and public sector reforms, anti-corruption measures within public institutions and the civil service, enhance the integrity of electoral processes ahead of Kenya&#x2019;s 2027 Elections, and to counter the use of illicit money in political activities in Kenya for the long-term.</narrative>
  </description>
